    "custom_liquid_3DHJKU": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  BowFlex Max Trainer FAQ\n  Shopify Custom Liquid\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<section class=\"bowflex-faq-section\">\n  <div class=\"bowflex-faq-container\">\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq-header\">\n      <span class=\"bowflex-faq-eyebrow\">MAX TRAINER</span>\n      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n      <p>\n        Find out more about BowFlex Max Trainer models, training benefits, home use and which model is right for your fitness goals.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-faq-group\">\n\n      <h3 class=\"bowflex-faq-category\">Product Fit &amp; Training Experience</h3>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>Why choose a BowFlex Max Trainer instead of a traditional elliptical trainer?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            A <strong>BowFlex Max Trainer</strong> is a strong choice for users who want more than a traditional elliptical workout. It combines elliptical-style low-impact movement with stepper-style climbing, creating a compact, full-body and higher-intensity cardio experience.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            Compared with a traditional elliptical trainer, which usually focuses on a longer and smoother gliding stride, a BowFlex Max Trainer helps users engage both the lower body and upper body in a more time-efficient workout.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            It is especially suitable for users who want <strong>low-impact training, calorie-burning cardio, interval workouts</strong> and a compact home fitness machine.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            Recommended options include <strong>BowFlex Max Trainer SEi</strong> for compact connected cardio, <strong>BowFlex Max Trainer M6i</strong> for high-intensity home interval training and <strong>BowFlex Max Trainer Total 40</strong> for a more premium connected training experience with a built-in touchscreen.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>Is a BowFlex Max Trainer suitable for apartments or small homes?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            Yes. BowFlex Max Trainer models are designed with a <strong>compact footprint</strong> compared with many traditional cardio machines.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            They are suitable for home training spaces when placed on a flat, stable surface with enough clearance for safe access and full movement.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            A floor mat is recommended to help protect the floor, improve stability and reduce vibration.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>What muscles does a BowFlex Max Trainer work?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            A BowFlex Max Trainer can help train the <strong>lower body, upper body and core</strong> when used with proper form.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            The stepper-style climbing motion works the <strong>legs and glutes</strong>, while the moving handlebars help engage the <strong>arms, shoulders, chest and back</strong>.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            Because the feet stay supported on the pedals, it provides a <strong>low-impact cardio workout</strong> while still involving multiple muscle groups.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>Is a BowFlex Max Trainer good for calorie-burning workouts?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n          <p>\n            Yes. BowFlex Max Trainer models are designed for efficient cardio workouts, including <strong>interval training, HIIT, endurance sessions and full-body cardio</strong>.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            Workout results depend on training intensity, duration, resistance level, user fitness level and consistency.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            For users who want shorter, more intense home cardio sessions, Max Trainer models are a strong option.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"bowflex-faq-item\">\n        <summary>\n          <span>Which BowFlex Max Trainer is right for me: SEi, M6 / M6i, or Max Total 40?</span>\n          <span class=\"bowflex-faq-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </summary>\n\n        <div class=\"bowflex-faq-answer\">\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex Max Trainer SEi</strong> is suitable for users who want quiet, compact cardio with a <strong>7-inch colour LCD display, 16 resistance levels, Bluetooth heart rate compatibility</strong> and JRNY training through a mobile device.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex Max Trainer M6 / M6i</strong> is a strong choice for users who want compact, high-intensity, low-impact training with <strong>16 resistance levels, a backlit LCD console, 4-grip handlebars, media shelf, USB charging</strong> and JRNY through a smartphone or tablet.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            <strong>BowFlex Max Total 40</strong> is the premium option for users who want a built-in <strong>16-inch adjustable HD touchscreen, 20 resistance levels, 6-grip handlebars, integrated JRNY and Bluetooth speakers</strong> for the most immersive connected training experience.\n          </p>\n\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .bowflex-faq-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 60px 20px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #161616;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-header {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin-bottom: 45px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-eyebrow {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 1.8px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-header h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: -0.8px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-header p {\n    margin: 0;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #555555;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-group {\n    margin-bottom: 42px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-group:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-category {\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item {\n    border-top: 1px solid #dedede;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #dedede;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item summary {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 25px;\n    padding: 23px 5px;\n    list-style: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item summary::marker {\n    content: \"\";\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item summary:hover {\n    opacity: 0.7;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-icon {\n    position: relative;\n    display: block;\n    flex: 0 0 18px;\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-icon::before,\n  .bowflex-faq-icon::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 2px;\n    background: currentColor;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-icon::after {\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(90deg);\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-item[open] .bowflex-faq-icon::after {\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg);\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-answer {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    padding: 0 45px 25px 5px;\n    color: #555555;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-answer p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-faq-answer strong {\n    color: #222222;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .bowflex-faq-section {\n      padding: 40px 16px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq-header {\n      margin-bottom: 35px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq-header h2 {\n      font-size: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq-header p {\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq-category {\n      font-size: 17px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq-item summary {\n      padding: 19px 2px;\n      font-size: 15.5px;\n      gap: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-faq-answer {\n      padding: 0 28px 22px 2px;\n      font-size: 14.5px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why choose a BowFlex Max Trainer instead of a traditional elliptical trainer?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A BowFlex Max Trainer combines elliptical-style low-impact movement with stepper-style climbing to create a compact, full-body and higher-intensity cardio workout. It is suitable for users who want low-impact training, calorie-burning cardio, interval workouts and a compact home fitness machine. Options include BowFlex Max Trainer SEi, BowFlex Max Trainer M6i and BowFlex Max Trainer Total 40.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is a BowFlex Max Trainer suitable for apartments or small homes?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. BowFlex Max Trainer models have a compact footprint compared with many traditional cardio machines and can be suitable for apartments and smaller home gyms when positioned on a flat, stable surface with sufficient clearance. A floor mat is recommended to protect flooring, improve stability and reduce vibration.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What muscles does a BowFlex Max Trainer work?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A BowFlex Max Trainer can train the lower body, upper body and core. The stepper-style movement works the legs and glutes, while the moving handlebars engage the arms, shoulders, chest and back. The supported pedal movement also provides a low-impact cardio workout.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is a BowFlex Max Trainer good for calorie-burning workouts?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. BowFlex Max Trainer models support calorie-burning cardio, interval training, HIIT, endurance sessions and full-body workouts. Results depend on factors including intensity, workout duration, resistance level, fitness level and consistency.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which BowFlex Max Trainer is right for me: SEi, M6 / M6i, or Max Total 40?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"BowFlex Max Trainer SEi offers compact cardio with a 7-inch colour LCD display, 16 resistance levels, Bluetooth heart rate compatibility and JRNY through a mobile device. BowFlex Max Trainer M6 or M6i offers 16 resistance levels, a backlit LCD console, 4-grip handlebars, media shelf, USB charging and JRNY through a smartphone or tablet. BowFlex Max Total 40 is the premium option with a built-in 16-inch adjustable HD touchscreen, 20 resistance levels, 6-grip handlebars, integrated JRNY and Bluetooth speakers.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
